Package: aquacropr.studio
Title: Shiny Studio for the aquacropr AquaCrop Workflow
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mohamed Jabloun", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "aquacropr@example.com")
Description: Graphical interface for the aquacropr package. Provides a Shiny
    studio to set up AquaCrop plugin projects, edit parameters, run
    simulations, define objective functions, and run calibration,
    sensitivity analysis, and space-filling design workflows.
